# Wikimedia image bytes fetched on demand by
# tests/fixtures/images/fetch_wikipedia.py. The fixtures README has
# described them as gitignored since the set was created, but no rule
# existed: two of them sat untracked in the tree for days, and one of
# the catalogue's entries is the Wikipedia globe — a Wikimedia
# trademark kept under fair use for test fixtures only, which is
# exactly the kind of byte that must not reach a published sdist by
# accident.
#
# wiki/truth.json stays tracked on purpose: the manifest is the source
# of truth, and the bytes are hash-pinned and regenerable from the CDN.
tests/fixtures/images/wiki/*.jpg
tests/fixtures/images/wiki/*.png
